{
 "about": "Contract cases for every provider in ../cloud-stt.json, run by the desktop (cloud.rs), Android (CloudTest.kt) and Chrome (cloud.test.ts) tests against a fake network. replies: [status, body] in order (a string body is sent as-is). requests: what each request must carry: method, path, one header (KEY = the test key), multipart form values (null = present, any value), query values, a JSON body subset, or a raw body content type. Bodies are the docs' own examples where the docs give one (see doc).",
